HISTORY deselected in the extraction process, the contents of the ith           HISTORY aperture in order j can be found as follows:                            HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0209.fits, spectra0210.fits,          HISTORY spectra0211.fits, spectra0212.fits, spectra0213.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0214.fits, spectra0215.fits, spectra0216.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0217.fits, spectra0218.fits, spectra0219.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0220.fits, spectra0221.fits, spectra0222.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0223.fits, spectra0224.fits were combined using a robust         HISTORY weighted mean with a sigma threshold of 8.  Aperture 1                  HISTORY modifications: The scale factors were determined using order 5          HISTORY and are: 0.8917825973107842, 1.000134647935172,                         HISTORY 1.0473468725685062, 0.9927507963321779, 0.8946143919552474,             HISTORY 0.9684556214736216, 0.959489286402788, 1.0013728586750685,              HISTORY 0.9604858817410561, 0.9998653883151987, 0.9426974103222286,             HISTORY 1.04904545942796, 1.0553227679627262, 1.1192202587934728,               HISTORY 1.1458133647861504, 1.1475680710381777.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             